Z||000000||My7Fieros||07-28-2000||03:49 PM||||A new employee was hired at the tickle me Elmo factory, and the next day she was at work on the assembly line.<BR>Later that day, a group of employees went to the boss to complain.<BR>"Production has literally come to a stand still" one employee said. "Shes going WAY to slow or something".<BR>The boss informed the employees that he'd go have a look. <BR>"Shes new" he thought to himself, "I'll just make sure shes doing ok".<BR>When the boss approached the new employee, he found the Elmo dolls being piled up at her station. He then noticed that she was taking two marbles, sewing them into a small bag, and sewing them between the legs of each of the Elmo dolls.<BR>He stared in amazement at her and what she was doing......then he started dieing out laughing.......<BR>"Susan", he said, "I said give each Tickle me Elmo TWO TEST TICKLES!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||7
